分别对应了，对自己的了解和掌控，对时间空间和筹码组合成的K线的理解，对组成市场的最小单位——“人”本身的理解以及整个市场构成的理解。</span> <button class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-brand hover:underline" type="button">Show more</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:1.6834381551362683"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/1844847104952533079/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="low" height="954" width="1606" alt="" class="w-full" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GZo2hC_b0AA6KWy?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GZo2hC_b0AA6KWy?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GZo2hC_b0AA6KWy?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GZo2hC_b0AA6KWy?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/1844847104952533079/photo/1"></a></div></div></div></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible @container"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/ZTZZBTC/status/1844847104952533079"><span class="relative isolate inline-flex items-center r